OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy start across
OL,6,Fthe region but generally dry.
OL,7,FPotential for brighter spells to
OL,8,Fdevelop at times through the day.
OL,9,FBreezy around the coast. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining generally cloudy
OL,13,Finto the evening. Isolated clearer
OL,14,Fspells may develop overnight but these
OL,15,Fwill be short-lived. Cool. Winds
OL,16,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
