OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA generally cloudy but dry day
OL,6,Fis likely. Isolated brighter spells
OL,7,Fpossible through the morning but cloud
OL,8,Fis unlikely to break up. Near average
OL,9,Ftemperatures. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate,
OL,13,Fhowever, cloud cover likely to break
OL,14,Fup allowing overnight mist and fog to
OL,15,Fdevelop, which will then clear slowly.
OL,16,FTemperatures remain around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
